    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大量の実体化ゼロムが
ノークインを目指し侵攻中！
全力で帰還せよッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A large quantity of materialized xerom are invading Norqueen! We must return as soon as physically possible!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5032</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;……
わたくしを捨てて
早くノークインに戻って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;, leave me behind. You must make it to Norqueen at once.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>コートがしゃべんなッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're just my coat, so quit yappin'!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>俺は捨てねぇぞ……
里も、意地も、希望も
てめぇも全部なッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I ain't throwin' anything away. Not the village, not my stubborn head, or hope. Nothin'! And you're included in that!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
